{"abstract":[{"text":"Some components can be used for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"layouts","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/layouts"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Layouts","role":"article","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"sections":[],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"text":"Colored Surface","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Colored-Surface"},{"tabs":[{"title":"Orange","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"title":"Sosh","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Wireframe","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Colored backgrounds use surface colors to maximize the contrast with content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The colors of several OUDS components (for instance ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":") are automatically adjusted if they are placed on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do so, some tokens associated with these specific colors can be customized and are identified with the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Mono","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" suffix (for instance ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"colorBgDefaultEnabledMono","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"text":"How it works","type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"How-it-works"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"According to the color, the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" component adds in SwiftUI environment two flags:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsUseMonochrome"},{"text":": to inform a component that needs to use mono version of tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsOnColoredSurface"},{"text":": to inform a component it is placed on colored surface even if the mono is off","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"How to use","type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The folowing view has a colored background \"onStatusPositiveEmphasized\" with","    \/\/ - a text with the color adapted according to the adjusted colorScheme      ","    \/\/ - a button that uses the mono version of tokens","","    \/\/ As view","    OUDSColoredSurface(color: theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized) {","        VStack {","            Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","            .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","            OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","        }","    }","","    \/\/ As view modifier","","    VStack {","        Text(\"Status Positive Emphasized\")","        .foregroundColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","","        OUDSButton(text: \"Button\") {}","    }","    .coloredSurface(theme.colorModes.onStatusPositiveEmphasized)"]},{"text":"Debuging contrast ratios","type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"Debuging-contrast-ratios"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is for example the case for France with the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/"},{"text":", also named “RGAA”.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However it is highly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for texts and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some components like ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink"},{"text":" can be used on ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface"},{"text":" ; thus in that case we can know the surface color for a given component on it, and compute the contrast ratio, and in the end display or not warnings.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To do that, some steps must be followed in your component implementation:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Rise the flag to allow debugging (e.g. i #DEBUG mode)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Get the environment variable defined by the colored surface containing the applied color","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In the component implementation, add a line of code comparing the color to test and that surface","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Then keep an eye on your logs ; warnings will be added there if WCAG 2.1 3:1, 4.5:1 or 7:1 ratios are not reached, depending to the methods you call","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Rise the flag","#if DEBUG","OUDSWCAG21Ratios.oudsDebugWCAG21Colors = true","#endif","","\/\/ Supposing we are in your component View \/ ViewModifer struct","","\/\/ Get the applied surface color","@Environment(\\.oudsSurfaceColor) var surfaceColor","","\/\/ In the function defining the color to apply, add the line below","\/\/ where colorTokenToApply is the color to apply from a theme:","","\/\/ Non-textual components, in AA","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .nonTextual)","","\/\/ Textual components and AAA to check","OUDSWCAG21Ratio.debugContrastRatio(colorToApply, surfaceColor, .AAA)"]},{"text":"Divider","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Divider"},{"text":"How it works","type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"How-it-works"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A divider is used to separate content elements in a view. Two kinds of divider are proposed:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked vertically (e.g. in ","type":"text"},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSVerticalDivider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": to separate elements stacked horizontally (e.g. in `HStack)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A divider can be colored using color enumerated in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSDividerColor"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Horizontal","type":"heading","level":5,"anchor":"Horizontal"},{"tabs":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Orange Compact"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Sosh"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Wireframe"}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"text":"Vertical","type":"heading","level":5,"anchor":"Vertical"},{"tabs":[{"title":"Orange","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Orange Compact","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Sosh","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"title":"Wireframe","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"tabNavigator"},{"text":"How to use","type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"How-to-use"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Add a vertical divider between items","HStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSVerticalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}","","\/\/ Add an horizontal divider between items","VStack {","    Text(\"Hello world!\")","    OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","    Text(\"Happy to see you\")","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"https://accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr/":{"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","type":"link","title":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","url":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr\/","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité"}]},"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe":{"identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe","type":"image","alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Wireframe.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSVerticalDivider":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSVerticalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsverticaldivider","title":"OUDSVerticalDivider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vertical Divider is used to separate content laid out side by side ("},{"code":"HStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The thickness (width) is fixed by dedicated token from "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSVerticalDivider","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSVerticalDivider","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSButton":{"title":"OUDSButton","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Button is a UI element that triggers an action or event, and is used to initiate tasks or confirming an action."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Button appears in different layouts, styles and states to indicate hierarchy or emphasis."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbutton","kind":"symbol"},"component_coloredSurface_Orange":{"identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Orange","type":"image","alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Orange theme","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSDividerColor":{"title":"OUDSDividerColor","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSDividerColor","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSDividerColor","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"List of colors available for dividers (i.e. "},{"code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"OUDSVerticalDivider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsdividercolor"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSColoredSurface":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSColoredSurface","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSColoredSurface","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Used to define if a content is used on a colored surface.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscoloredsurface","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"OUDSColoredSurface","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface"},"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_OrangeCompact"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLink":{"title":"OUDSLink","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLink","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLink","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Link is a UI element that allows to navigate from one location to another, either within the same page or across different pages in the same resource,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or to an external resource."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Link’s primary function is navigation and it communicates its interactive nature visually and semantically."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLink","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslink","kind":"symbol"},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},"component_verticalDivider_Orange":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Orange theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Orange"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"type":"topic","title":"Components","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents"},"component_horizontalDivider_Orange":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Orange theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Orange"},"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_OrangeCompact"},"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_OrangeCompact"},"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Wireframe.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Wireframe"},"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_horizontalDivider_Sosh.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"An horizontal divider in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_horizontalDivider_Sosh"},"component_verticalDivider_Sosh":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_verticalDivider_Sosh.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"An vertical divider in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_verticalDivider_Sosh"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSHorizontalDivider":{"title":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSHorizontalDivider","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Divider is a UI element that allows to structure the content by visually separating the content zones."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Divider improves readability and content organization without introducing a stronger visual hierarchy like a heading or a container would."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A horizontal Divider is used to separate content laid out one under the other ("},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The divider can be colored using dedicated "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSDividerColor","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" colors."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The thickness (height) is fixed by dedicated token from "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSHorizontalDivider","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudshorizontaldivider"},"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Wireframe.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Wireframe theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Wireframe"},"component_coloredSurface_Sosh":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_coloredSurface_Sosh.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A colored surface with text, button and link in light and dark modes with Sosh theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_coloredSurface_Sosh"}}}